0: DECL INT, _σ_len_1
1: PUSH 4
2: STORE _σ_len_1
3: PUSH 1
4: PUSH 4
5: MUL
6: LDECL LIST[INT], σ
7: STEP
8: PUSH 10
9: PUSH 20
10: PUSH 30
11: PUSH 40
12: PUSH 4
13: STORE σ
14: STEP
15: VERI 0, '∀ κ in [0...3] . σ[&κ] > 0'
16: VERI 1, '∃ κ in [0...3] . σ[&κ] = 30'
17: VERI 2, '∀ ε in σ . &ε >= 10'